# Committed sim MOTE_HOME: the per-world site bundles under sites/ are checked
# in (maps + zones), but per-run mutable state is not.
active.yaml
bags/
# Identity is per-machine state; a `pixi run identity set` from the sim
# environment lands here because MOTE_HOME points at this directory.
robot.yaml

# The slam posegraph exists only to *continue* mapping in the same frame later;
# the sim always maps a world fresh (tools/map_world.sh), so it is never loaded
# here and would just add ~100 MB of binary blobs to the repo. nav only needs
# map.png + map.yaml. Kept out of git (regenerated locally on each save).
*.posegraph
*.data
